                "markdown": "Detected direct use of jinja2. If not done properly, this may bypass HTML escaping which opens up the application to cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerabilities. Prefer using the Flask method 'render_template()' and templates with a '.html' extension in order to prevent XSS.\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/python.flask.security.xss.audit.direct-use-of-jinja2.direct-use-of-jinja2)\n - [https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/en/2.11.x/api/#basics](https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/en/2.11.x/api/#basics)\n"
